You are reviewing the changes on the current branch relative to origin/master (inspect them with `git diff origin/master...HEAD` and `git log origin/master..HEAD`). Do not modify any files. Do not commit or push.

This branch prepares the LCI v2.0.0 release (PR uiuc-hpc/lci#212). It contains:
- a new changelog, docs/changelogs/changelog_2_0_0.md, covering changes since v2.0.0-beta.1;
- the version suffix and git-hash handling in CMakeLists.txt;
- liblci.pc.in / pkg-config generation;
- LCIConfigVersion SameMajorVersion and the CMake config moved to lib/cmake/LCI;
- a FindOFI pkg-config check fix;
- Spack package fixes (contrib/spack/packages/lci/package.py);
- a header fix for get_*_algorithm_str.

Review for correctness bugs and release-blocking issues. In particular:
(1) any changelog claim that is inaccurate against `git diff v2.0.0-beta.1 HEAD`, or any important breaking change it omits;
(2) build, install, or packaging regressions: FetchContent consumers, installed config/targets, pkg-config with each backend, Spack @1 vs @2;
(3) anything else that should be fixed before tagging v2.0.0.
Report only concrete, verified issues with file:line and evidence.

